config HEALTH_MONITOR
	bool "Opt-in Health Monitor core"
	default n
	depends on !SMP && !SCHED_TICKLESS && !SCHED_TICKSUPPRESS
	depends on !APP_BINARY_SEPARATION
	help
		Self-only non-blocking start/stop/kick with a lazy deadline heap.
		Requires single CPU periodic ticks. No automatic registrations.
		Timeout or exit without stop dumps diagnostics and panics in the
		tick ISR. Does not provision a hardware watchdog. task_monitor is
		independent and remains available. See docs/health_monitor.md.
